 both sides of the equation by $-1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{5}x+y & =2 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5}x+y) & =(-1)\\cdot (2) \\\\ \\frac{1}{5}x-y & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply both sides of the equation by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{5}x-y & =-2 \\\\ 5\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5}x-y) & =5\\cdot (-2) \\\\ x-5y & =-10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, $a,b,$ and $c$ are integers with no common factors, and $a\\ge 0.$ So we are done!\n\nThe standard form of the line is $x-5y=-10.$"] ["question-7f25e8cf-a84e-5491-8095-e34846bd72c0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-dad8335d-f4a7-566b-a578-6ac7a63c8d7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "dad8335d-f4a7-566b-a578-6ac7a63c8d7b"] ["answer-9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" :answer/id #uuid "9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a"] ["answer-9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9061fc30-c374-57e8-aa75-804d2bbafc4a" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}x-y=-2"] ["answer-fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" :answer/id #uuid "fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8"] ["answer-fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-fa2a9e76-21e6-55c2-8f02-1bd6cfa3e2c8" :answer/value "x+5y=5"] ["answer-bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" :answer/id #uuid "bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f"] ["answer-bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bd9e69fa-90c3-5ff9-b4f9-43eaf28f779f" :answer/value "x-5y+10=0"] ["answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer/id #uuid "448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e"] ["answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-448eccfb-3c08-5bec-841b-585bee529c4e" :answer/value "x-5y=-10"] ["answer-60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a" :answer/id #uuid "60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a"] ["answer-60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-60d77254-fa6e-530c-8178-4237af50304a" :answer/value "